<p>Upon expiring the corpselight implodes, pulling in all foes towards its center and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> cold damage.</p><p>The damage is increased by +10% per stack.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p><p></p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Learning this spell will make Corpselight cost two souls to use instead of one.</p>